======================================================================

E4 chart: x = x0 + x'*y', y = y'. E4 = {y'=0}.
Pullback term (J,K):
  (c+(x0+x'y')y')^{-J-K} (tau0+y')^{-J} (x0+x'y')^{-J} (y')^{-J}

y'^{-2} requires J=2. Coefficient (set y'=0):
